  "Create a launch",
  "Currently staging on the public testnet.",
  "Factory owner only. One signature deploys the token, its PancakeSwap Infinity pool hook and the developer's Circuit NFT, and opens a gas-gated funding round that cannot close early. There is no launch fee.",
  "1",
  "Identity",
  "Logo",
  "T",
  "Upload token logo",
  "PNG, JPEG, GIF or WebP · up to 1 MB",
