  "Developer address",
  "[placeholder] 0x…",
  "Receives the Circuit NFT — and with it the 99% shelf revenue and the genesis fees. Fixed at deploy.",
  "3",
  "Caps",
  "Immutable. Deposits stop at the hard cap, and no single wallet can put in more than the per-wallet cap.",
  "No hard cap — the round runs to its deadline and closes only when time is up.",
  "Hard cap (TQUOTE)",
  "[placeholder] 1000",
  "Between 30 and 20000 TQUOTE.",
  "Per-wallet cap (TQUOTE)",
