  "What this costs",
  "No launch fee — gas only, over two transactions.",
  "Gas, deploy now",
  "0.0005676 tBNB",
  "Gas, open pool later",
  "0.0006769 tBNB",
  "tBNB gas only, estimated at the current rate, which moves before signing. Opening the pool is a later transaction the factory owner sends through factory.launch(hook).",
  "No upgrade path and no admin key over the token: the terms above are fixed in the contract's own bytecode at deploy, and only this project's contract can ever mint. The platform keeps one bounded brake — it can pause shelf minting for up to 7 days at a time, on the record, and it can never reach a deposit, a refund or a claim.",
  "[title] 0x9fE46736679d2D9a65F0992F2272dE9f3c7fa6e0",
  "Factory 0x9fE4…a6e0",
  "[aria-label] copy address",
