r0.0006769 tBNBtBNB gas only, estimated at the current rate, which moves before signing. Opening the pool is a later transaction the factory owner sends through factory.launch(hook).No upgrade path and no admin key over the token: the terms above are fixed in the contract's own bytecode at deploy, and only this project's contract can ever mint. The platform keeps one bounded brake — it can pause shelf minting for up to 7 days at a time, on the record, and it can never reach a deposit, a refund or a claim.Factory 0x9fE4…a6e0I confirm these immutable terms: developer 0x3c44…93bc, hard cap 1000 TQUOTE, per-wallet cap 500 TQUOTE, a 24-hour genesis window that cannot close early — and a full refund to every depositor if the pool is not opened within 7 days, or if the raise finishes too small to open one.The per-wallet cap must be above zero and no more than the hard cap.Create launchDeploy reserves the pool address before the wallet opens, so expect a moment before the prompt.CancelPreviewnot yet deployedT$TESTTest AgentYour description appears here as you type.Window24hPool address0x0b95…1409This is how your launch appears in the directory once it confirms./// DIALSFactory limitsRead from the factory now.Owner0x7099…79C8Hard cap range30–20000 TQUOTEPoG allocation ceiling500 TQUOTENetworkBNB Smart Chain Testnet"`;

