ook).No upgrade path and no admin key over the token: the terms above are fixed in the contract's own bytecode at deploy, and only this project's contract can ever mint. The platform keeps one bounded brake — it can pause shelf minting for up to 7 days at a time, on the record, and it can never reach a deposit, a refund or a claim.Factory 0x9fE4…a6e0Reading the factory — the terms appear here with their real numbers in them.Reading the factory…→ Fetching the factory owner and its cap limits before anything can be signed.Deploy reserves the pool address before the wallet opens, so expect a moment before the prompt.CancelPreviewnot yet deployed?$SYMBOLProject nameYour description appears here as you type.Window24hPool addressground at deployThis is how your launch appears in the directory once it confirms./// DIALSFactory limitsRead from the factory now.Owner—Hard cap range—PoG allocation ceiling—NetworkBNB Smart Chain Testnet"`;

